# Mumbai House Price Analyzer — Complete Project Documentation
### Language: Hinglish (Hindi + English)
### Subject: Java + Python Mini Project

---

## 1. Project Ka Overview (Introduction)

Is project mein humne ek **Mumbai House Price Prediction** system banaya hai.  
Iska kaam yeh hai ki user ghar ki details enter kare — jaise area, bedrooms, locality — aur system automatically **estimated price** bata de.

**Technology Stack:**
| Part | Technology |
|------|-----------|
| Machine Learning (AI brain) | Python 3 + scikit-learn |
| User Interface (UI) | Java Swing + AWT |
| Data Communication | stdin/stdout JSON bridge |
| Dataset | Mumbai houses CSV (71,938 rows) |
| JSON Parsing (Java mein) | json-simple library |

