## 5. Java Code — OOP Concepts ka Explanation

### 5.1 OOP Kya Use Kiya?

| OOP Concept | Kahan Use Kiya | Kaise |
|-------------|---------------|-------|
| **Abstract Class** | [BasePanel.java](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/BasePanel.java) | `abstract void loadData()` — har panel ko implement karna padega |
| **Interface** | [Predictable.java](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/Predictable.java) | [predict()](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/PredictionPanel.java#203-317) method ka contract define karta hai |
| **Inheritance** | [PredictionPanel](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/PredictionPanel.java#18-345), [DataPanel](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/DataPanel.java#16-230), [ChartPanel](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/ChartPanel.java#15-341) | Teeno `extends BasePanel` karte hain |
| **Interface Implementation** | [PredictionPanel](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/PredictionPanel.java#18-345) | `implements Predictable` |
| **Polymorphism** | [MainApp.java](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/MainApp.java) | Teeno panels ko [BasePanel](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/BasePanel.java#8-48) ki tarah treat karta hai |
| **Encapsulation** | Har file mein | Saare fields `private` hain, methods se access hote hain |

---

### 5.2 [BasePanel.java](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/BasePanel.java) — Abstract Parent Class

```java
public abstract class BasePanel extends JPanel {
    protected String panelTitle;

    public abstract void loadData();   // ← ABSTRACT - subclass must implement

    public void showError(String msg) { ... }   // common error popup
    public JLabel makeLabel(String text, ...) { ... }  // common label helper
}
```

**Kyun banaya?**  
Taki teeno panels mein common code ek jagah ho. DRY principle (Don't Repeat Yourself).

---

### 5.3 [Predictable.java](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/Predictable.java) — Interface

```java
public interface Predictable {
    void predict();   // abstract - koi bhi class jo predict karti hai implement kare

    default boolean isValidNumber(String s) {   // default method
        try { Double.parseDouble(s); return true; }
        catch (NumberFormatException e) { return false; }
    }
}
```

**Kyun banaya?**  
Interface ek "contract" hota hai. Agar [PredictionPanel](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/PredictionPanel.java#18-345) [Predictable](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/Predictable.java#5-22) implement karta hai, toh guarantee hai ki usmein [predict()](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/PredictionPanel.java#203-317) method hogi.

---

### 5.4 [PredictionPanel.java](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/PredictionPanel.java) — Main Prediction UI

```java
public class PredictionPanel extends BasePanel implements Predictable {
```
Yeh class **BasePanel bhi extend karta hai aur Predictable bhi implement karta hai** — yeh Java mein multiple inheritance ka ek tarika hai.

**Important parts:**

- [loadData()](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/ChartPanel.java#37-153) — `meta.json` se locality/property list load karta hai
- [setupUI()](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/PredictionPanel.java#109-183) — JComboBox, JSpinner se form banata hai
- [predict()](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/PredictionPanel.java#203-317) — Python script ko call karta hai via `ProcessBuilder`
- [buildInputJson()](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/PredictionPanel.java#318-344) — user input ko JSON string mein convert karta hai

**Error Handling:**
```java
try {
    process = pb.start();                  // python start karo
    writer.println(inputJson);             // input bhejo
    result = reader.readLine();            // output padho
    process.waitFor();                     // wait karo khatam hone tak
} catch (IOException e) {
    throw new Exception("Python nahi chala: " + e.getMessage());
} catch (InterruptedException e) {
    throw new Exception("Process rok diya gaya.");
} finally {
    if (process != null) process.destroy(); // cleanup karo
}
```

