### 5.5 [DataPanel.java](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/DataPanel.java) — CSV Table Viewer

- `JTable` + `DefaultTableModel` use kiya data dikhane ke liye
- **Background loading:** `SwingWorker` se CSV background mein load hota hai taaki UI freeze na ho
- **Search:** `KeyAdapter` se real-time filtering — user type karta hai aur table filter hoti hai
- Column headers **black color** mein hain

**Try-catch kahan:**
```java
try {
    BufferedReader reader = new BufferedReader(new FileReader(csvPath));
    ...
    reader.close();
} catch (FileNotFoundException e) {
    showError("CSV file nahi mili: " + csvPath);
} catch (IOException e) {
    showError("File read error: " + e.getMessage());
}
```

