### 5.7 [MainApp.java](file:///c:/Users/rajan/Downloads/JavaProject/src/MainApp.java) — Main Window

- `JFrame` extend karta hai
- `JTabbedPane` se 3 tabs banaye
- `SwingUtilities.invokeLater()` se UI thread-safe tarike se launch hoti hai
- **Anonymous `Runnable`** use kiya — OOP ka anonymous inner class concept

```java
SwingUtilities.invokeLater(new Runnable() {   // anonymous class
    @Override
    public void run() {
        new MainApp();   // window banao
    }
});
```

