## 9. Error Handling Summary

| Error Situation | Kahan Handle | Kaise |
|----------------|-------------|-------|
| `model.pkl` nahi mila | `MainApp.java` | Warning dialog + option to exit |
| `meta.json` nahi mila | `PredictionPanel.java` | `FileNotFoundException` catch → Warning popup |
| Python nahi chala | `PredictionPanel.java` | `IOException` catch → Error message |
| CSV nahi mili | `DataPanel.java` | `FileNotFoundException` catch → Error popup |
| File read error | `DataPanel.java` | `IOException` catch |
| Invalid JSON | `predict_server.py` | `json.JSONDecodeError` catch → error JSON |
| Invalid number | `Predictable.java` | `NumberFormatException` catch in default method |
| Model missing | `predict_server.py` | `FileNotFoundError` catch → exit(1) |

